  "step_3": "The information relevant to the decision reason — the sum of pairwise differences of outcomes — is not considered by the individual. The individual only discusses the probability of earning 3000€, not the differences between outcomes. Furthermore, the decision reason's rule is to prefer the lottery with the more favorable sum of outcome differences, which in this case is identical for both lotteries (only one difference of 1000€), so no preference should be derived from it. The individual’s justification is based on a different criterion — the probability of a specific outcome — not on the sum of outcome differences. Therefore, the decision reason was not used in the deliberation process. The individual did not apply or refer to the sum of pairwise outcome differences in any way.",
  "final_assessment_score": 0
